{"actor_agent_id":"01M2F9SEH6F82C5FNN2P8NREAN","aggregate_id":"01M2F9WERA90JF9A582XBZD3QB","aggregate_type":"task.created","id":"01M2F9WERA90JF9A582XBZD3QB","occurred_at":"2026-09-14T06:32:45.059178511+00:00","payload_json":"{\"description\":\"Priority: P2 | Area: docs | Labels: docs,area:docs,P2 | Milestone: v0.1.0 | RFC: OQ-053 | Task: CTX-0003\\n\\nCross-repo work for bitty CTX-0426 (official plugin onboarding order and registration policy). Owner repo: bitty-plugins-docs.\\n\\nDeliverable: product/official-plugin-onboarding.md (document_type policy, status normative) covering:\\n- official versus community boundary and entry criteria;\\n- registration checklist (template repo, SDK lint clean, capability review, docs page set, minimal registry entry, submodule pinned to a mainline commit, regenerate + validate);\\n- bundled-split order of operations (port -> register -> remove bundled -> docs sync) with merge-order hazards: stacked-base auto-close (bitty-plugins PR #6 merged with branch deletion auto-closed child PR #7 at 2026-09-14T05:44:25Z; recovered as PR #9) and the rule to never delete a base branch while a child PR uses it; shared-artifact conflicts in generated/registry.json and .gitmodules;\\n- version and compatibility policy; review requirements (independent reviewer, different agent); maintenance rules (pin bumps, deprecation/removal, security review triggers).\\n\\nAlso update docs/README.md navigation. Cross-link product/bundled-plugin-split-decision.md (accepted) and cite the observed PR sequence as the recorded lesson. Do not edit product/plugin-roadmap.md or the split decision record while bitty-plugins-docs PR #9 (CTX-0424) is open.\\n\\nAcceptance: just check green, git diff --check clean, PR linked to the bitty-plugins registry PR and bitty CTX-0426, no merge.\",\"displayId\":\"CTX-0003\",\"id\":\"01M2F9WER35DK1T9WD1ZXADSN3\",\"priority\":\"normal\",\"status\":\"ready\",\"title\":\"docs(product): official plugin onboarding policy (bitty CTX-0426)\"}","project_id":"01M2DX0MBKQR9TV48HHMN1QBJS","session_id":null,"task_id":"01M2F9WER35DK1T9WD1ZXADSN3","type":"task.created"}
